		{"id":"f4a41fccc1468e61","type":"text","text":"Once they reach Wild Port and begin walking around Orin will kidnap Orlli and take him to the temple of Bhaal where she will try to lure the party into a trap. She will taunt them taking his place\n","x":-500,"y":-80,"width":625,"height":90},
